<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT CAMBRIDGE UNIVERSITY.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-WESTERN SAMOA BEAT CAMBRIDGE UNIVERSITY.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, England 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Samoa beat Cambridge University 14-13 (halftime 14-5) in a rugby union tour match on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Cambridge University - Tries: Richard Bramley, Morgan Garfield. Penalty: Rob Ashforth.</p>
<p>Western Samoa - Tries: Mark Fatialofa, To'o Vaega. Conversions: Fa'avaivai Tanoai (2).</p>
</text>
